# dd on a done project in the Logbook deletes it with its children, also removing the child's entry; z restores both.
file <<END
Sprint: @done({today})
	- Ticket A @done({today-1})
	- Ticket B
- Unrelated @done({today-2})
END
keys gL
see ▌ Sprint:
keys dd
hide Ticket A
see ▌ ✔ Unrelated
saved <<END
- Unrelated @done({today-2})
END
keys z
see ✔ Ticket A  Sprint
quit
saved <<END
Sprint: @done({today})
	- Ticket A @done({today-1})
	- Ticket B
- Unrelated @done({today-2})
END
